{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"e9118de69acf9cec","type":"text","text":"随机从藏阁提供三个方向 -\n要求：保持创作者主体性，主旨是提供创作者判断，筛选的能力等","x":318,"y":-545,"width":482,"height":95},
		{"id":"dc8eb38e2ed90659","type":"text","text":"Inbox收录内容： \n\n","x":-20,"y":-640,"width":270,"height":50},
		{"id":"99746153c315987b","type":"text","text":"从藏阁开始共创：\n","x":-20,"y":-505,"width":270,"height":50},
		{"id":"b5df850277172d3a","type":"text","text":"成卷 ","x":-20,"y":-350,"width":270,"height":50},
		{"id":"612a0e6b77717aef","type":"text","text":"进入共创模式","x":-320,"y":-510,"width":190,"height":60},
		{"id":"212371fc95c77a17","type":"text","text":"文境1.0 的问题：\n**我们如何知道，创作者是否真的保持了主体性？**\n","x":0,"y":-150,"width":270,"height":140},
		{"id":"be960e2ad7a0776b","type":"text","text":"文境2.0的方向：\n主体性画像（Agency Profile）\n\n","x":0,"y":147,"width":270,"height":72},
		{"id":"f35ba8cbd6e9e21f","type":"text","text":"文境3.0的方向：","x":0,"y":440,"width":270,"height":60},
		{"id":"b575a7984b17d3bd","type":"text","text":"进入开发者模式","x":-320,"y":153,"width":197,"height":60},
		{"id":"3413cab8c98eb6c1","type":"text","text":"通读Agent初始化说明- 提供两个选择","x":-720,"y":-180,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"9e8ee99dcfc95f73","type":"text","text":"Agent 初始化说明","x":-720,"y":-375,"width":250,"height":50},
		{"id":"1b45700d8dbca362","type":"text","text":"Markdown Runtime： Agent 不需要记住所有规范，而是在需要的时候，自动发现（Discover）并加载（Load）对应的 Workflow。","x":-567,"y":1480,"width":355,"height":160},
		{"id":"79e72f8c8f929d80","type":"text","text":"Embedded Workflow（嵌入式工作流）","x":-567,"y":1380,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"14089be07fe6af03","type":"text","text":"按需加载（Lazy Loading）","x":-514,"y":540,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"79856be26e2d9fec","type":"text","text":"Mode  \n│  \n├── Development  \n│ │  \n│ └── Development Runtime  \n│  \n└── Creator  \n│  \n└── Conversation Runtime  \n│  \n├── Capture Workflow  \n├── Organization Workflow  \n├── Archive Workflow  \n└── Reflection Workflow","x":880,"y":-300,"width":710,"height":350},
		{"id":"2e8817509ac6f0a3","type":"text","text":"Protocol  \n│  \n▼  \nMode Selection  \n│  \n▼  \nRouting  \n│  \n├──────────────┐  \n▼                                ▼  \nCreator Path     Development Path","x":880,"y":183,"width":323,"height":315,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"cf1df8247a712e56","type":"text","text":"# Runtime 生命周期\n\n```\nDevelopment Entry        │        ▼Current Context        │        ▼State Check        │        ├──────────────┐        ▼              ▼已有State      无State        │              │        ▼              ▼恢复State     创建Initial State        │              │        └──────┬───────┘               ▼             Ready\n```","x":1341,"y":213,"width":249,"height":477},
		{"id":"db81780474ea4731","type":"text","text":"把 **Development 拆成了三个层**：\n\n- **Protocol Layer（规则层）**\n- **State Layer（状态层）**\n- **Knowledge Layer（知识层）**\n\n这样以后所有新增模块，都可以先问一个问题：\n\n> **它是在定义规则？记录当前状态？还是沉淀长期知识？**","x":1200,"y":-780,"width":420,"height":380},
		{"id":"42baf7a63077340e","type":"text","text":"\n它通过持续提高创作者对自身思考、判断与协作过程的可见性，使成长始终来自创作者自己的观察、验证与修正，而不是来自系统预设的方向。\n同时还要建立起效率比较高的沟通交互界面-依托智能体的功能，目前倾向于hermes agent ，比如给出选择+自主输入方向，此行为需要被记录和复盘，做主体性创作比例的参考\n","x":323,"y":385,"width":477,"height":170},
		{"id":"da82250deafd0880","type":"text","text":"帮助创作者持续观察：\n自己是否仍然保持独立判断\n协作记忆（Collaboration Memory）：\n协作记忆记录的是协作过程本身，而不是作品内容","x":323,"y":122,"width":477,"height":122},
		{"id":"ecb40214f32b0010","type":"text","text":"主体性的反馈闭环（Feedback Loop）；它通过持续提高创作者对自身思考、判断与协作过程的可见性，使成长始终来自创作者自己的观察、验证与修正，而不是来自系统预设的方向。","x":338,"y":-135,"width":462,"height":110},
		{"id":"e8c7ce1c25cae3df","type":"text","text":"经过一系列的共创过程-根据要求生成卷 ；保留在成卷文件夹\n因为是本地md文件，所以创作者可以自行修改- Agent下一次接管的时候察觉 有更改，启动评估程序","x":338,"y":-375,"width":462,"height":100},
		{"id":"346dc35db0fea0e8","type":"text","text":"图片/文字/链接/想法/灵感/梦境/随笔...","x":300,"y":-655,"width":500,"height":80}
